    "texture": {
        "code": "// FREQUENCY comes from the F slider (Constants dock): raise F for finer\n// stripes, lower it for wider ones. F = 1 is the width this preset has\n// always had. max() keeps the stripes from vanishing if F is left at 0.\nfloat FREQ = 10.0 * max(F, 0.05);   // slider F\n\n// Compute how much each axis (X, Y, Z) weighs based on the normal\nvec3 blend = abs(n_model);\nblend /= max(blend.x + blend.y + blend.z, 0.00001);\n\n// Generate different procedural patterns for each projection plane\nvec3 colX = vec3(sin(pModel.y * FREQ) * 0.5 + 0.5, 0.0, 0.0); // Red stripes on the YZ plane\nvec3 colY = vec3(0.0, sin(pModel.x * FREQ) * 0.5 + 0.5, 0.0); // Green stripes on the XZ plane\nvec3 colZ = vec3(0.0, 0.0, sin(pModel.x * FREQ) * 0.5 + 0.5); // Blue stripes on the XY plane\n\n// Blend the patterns using the normal weights\ntextureCol = colX * blend.x + colY * blend.y + colZ * blend.z;",
